[{"title":"正统已已年丽寇至缙云大肆摽掠延杀无辜乡氓赵氏女自经死钟氏妇堕南岩宛予特赋其事二首 其二 钟氏妇","author":"樊阜","text":"少微黯淡妖氛横，长蛇封豕生荒荆。\n群动缠臊土花赤，比邻襁负驰奔征。\n钟家少妇离房户，黄口呱呱尚含乳。\n姑章夫婿晓星沈，呜咽吞声泪如雨。\n云边鸟道南岩阴，剑锋欲起桑间心。\n妾身可粉骨可碎，妾心百鍊真刚金。\n绿鬓红颜堕空碧，血腥著树浮寒色。\n弗容窦女独留芳，猿鹤悲鸣天亦黑。\n吁嗟冠屦称男儿，堂堂大节翻手隳。\n愚妇犹能保贞素，读圣贤书奚以为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27124,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋胡妇","author":"樊阜","text":"东风骀荡花媚娇，鸦鬟腻滑飞翠翘。\n露沁金莲一湾小，纤葱缓撚柔桑条。\n兰闺护暖蚕苗密，细叶如钿竹筐湿。\n罗襦歘霍雕鞍光，薄情正在桑阴立。\n黄金出袖妾心惊，妾心瑩比冰雪清。\n弹筝巧让罗敷女，田蚕婉语羞无情。\n叶渐盈筐返庭砌，阿姑喜溢双眉际。\n飏言锦绣归故闾，整顿姿容见夫婿。\n河水渊沄百丈深，冰肌矢向龙宫沈。\n匪曰忘姑陨非命，丝弦絙急讹徽音。\n精英叱咤沙头鬼，烈风迅激愁云起。\n凡人生女须嫁人，莫嫁秋胡薄情人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27125,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"路傍草","author":"樊阜","text":"路傍草，能得青青几时好。\n春风披拂随时生，一夜秋霜尽枯槁。\n贫家养女方及笄，结束嫁作征人妻。\n辛苦等閒容易老，生世如同路傍草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27126,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禽言六首 其一","author":"樊阜","text":"姑恶姑恶姑不恶，田荒姑嗔煮粥薄。\n我怨田荒不怨姑，今年劝夫力东作。\n姑恶姑恶姑不恶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禽言六首 其二","author":"樊阜","text":"不如归去谁肯归，饱食廪米衣锦衣。\n异乡虽好非桑梓，慈母倚门白发稀。\n不如归去谁肯归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禽言六首 其三","author":"樊阜","text":"脱却布裤休脱裤，力作任从泥淖污。\n去年徵租遗拷瘢，露见恐教儿女怖。\n脱却布裤休脱裤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禽言六首 其四","author":"樊阜","text":"提葫芦，休提壶，频沽囊底空青蚨。\n年荒茅屋炊烟断，明府上来须禁沽。\n提葫芦，休提壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禽言六首 其五","author":"樊阜","text":"婆饼焦，饼不焦，年丰麦贱充徵苗。\n再烧好饼与婆吃，妾吃焦饼从腹枵。\n婆饼焦，婆不焦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禽言六首 其六","author":"樊阜","text":"行不上也行得上，羊肠路险堪掉鞅。\n时人心险胜羊肠，仆马覆车一反掌。\n行不上也行得上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平田耕烟","author":"樊阜","text":"莎草翻烟雨霢霂，一犁耕破湖田绿。\n声声布谷隔林啼，馌妇厨中炊黍熟。\n秋收但得了官租，卒岁辛勤无叹吁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澄潭钓月","author":"樊阜","text":"寒潭皱碧流潦缩，霜娥飞落波心浴。\n兰桡中夜系空明，长线牵摇一团玉。\n小鱼跳跃大鱼潜，桂花香冷莎纤纤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉洞仙踪","author":"樊阜","text":"青林杳霭山岩峣，乱石齿齿堆琼瑶。\n丹灶苔深仙府旧，桃花流水生危桥。\n何时独跨一鹤小，飞入苍烟觅芝草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"密岭樵唱","author":"樊阜","text":"高杉乱筱霏晴烟，鸟道盘回出半天。\n非徵非商曲声杳，看棋未遇柯山仙。\n谁羡红裙侑觞饮，娇歌解博缠头锦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豹阙晴峦","author":"樊阜","text":"春声振谷蜀鸟啼，苦竹丛深云影低。\n芙蓉簇簇溪西岸，小雨帘纤寒翠迷。\n山人拄笏楼头看，天际联牵青不断。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙岩梵刹","author":"樊阜","text":"青林路小苔花湿，绀宇玲珑片云隔。\n仙人跨鹤去不来，岩隙残碑篆痕碧。\n老僧入定空夕阳，花落溪西春雨香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洼樽篆迹","author":"樊阜","text":"洼樽落落冈头石，铭篆春深藓痕碧。\n阳冰去远猿鹤愁，载酒何人吊陈迹。\n幽禽不语岩花香，今古悠悠空夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27139,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓石苔痕","author":"樊阜","text":"老树阴阴荫寒渌，石矶苔湿香露沃。\n毛翁古篆看不真，千载何人觅馀躅。\n芦花瑟瑟惊西风，短笛一声残照中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27140,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访陈时律","author":"樊阜","text":"故人鸡黍约，沙路入村微。\n痛饮一宵醉，清游两日归。\n古松低石屋，修竹映山扉。\n双鹭翩翩起，横塘净夕晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27141,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再和前韵","author":"樊阜","text":"维摩高阁起层层，驻马空门试一登。\n双嶂湿云寒阁雨，半岩枯树倒悬藤。\n鹤行松径迎来客，猿坐蒲团伴病僧。\n浮世茫茫如梦幻，宁须吊古泪沾膺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27142,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过正等寺访圭上人","author":"樊阜","text":"山影横溪夕照微，数声清磬隔溪西。\n石门晴雪落松响，沙岛寒云压竹低。\n结社喜逢今惠远，留衣犹想昔昌黎。\n焚香已了三生话，猿鸟无情只谩啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27143,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨晴游洞宫山坐间复雨","author":"樊阜","text":"神仙台观翳岚霏，金鼎丹成草木辉。\n潭静毒龙依石卧，山寒孤鹤伴云飞。\n半帘暝色松杉静，一箸春香笋蕨肥。\n俗事累人催白发，来游此地澹忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27144,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早行","author":"樊阜","text":"王事匆匆每计程，疏钟未动促前征。\n霜摧豆叶蛩声切，露滴松根鹤梦惊。\n极目关河悲远道，侧身天地叹浮生。\n微官不似归耕好，却向何人说此情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27145,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上虞逆旅见旧题感怀","author":"樊阜","text":"十年为客任东西，又御篮舆过竹溪。\n雨歇野田双鹭下，月残村店一鸡啼。\n解囊沽酒酬新债，即景成诗续旧题。\n记得西堂寻短梦，池塘春草绿初齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27146,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏幽居","author":"樊阜","text":"茅庐低小种桑围，妻喜蚕收欲上机。\n雀乳空檐花点点，莺啼深巷柳依依。\n交情自笑缘贫减，生计谁怜向老微。\n细雨池塘新水滑，芰荷初发未堪衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27147,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中示子","author":"樊阜","text":"东邻离别恨依依，我欲甘贫静掩扉。\n风送泉声清绕枕，云蒸岚翠冷侵衣。\n一春吟对庭花好，几日饥餐野蕨肥。\n却笑虚名成底事，不如倦鸟亦知归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27148,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起偶题","author":"樊阜","text":"空山静夜不分更，睡觉虚窗日影明。\n应为不才忘仕志，却缘多病见交情。\n白云自放生前懒，青史谁留死后名。\n食取充饥闻往哲，呼儿挑菜煮新羹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27149,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日偶成","author":"樊阜","text":"砚池香沁墨云乾，酒醒无情懒著冠。\n燕子归迟春初尽，落花吹雨小楼寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27150,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅夹竹图","author":"樊阜","text":"罗浮仙子宴瑶池，香脸生春酒晕微。\n欲吊湘灵无处觅，青鸾骑向月中归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27151,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景为陈时律题","author":"樊阜","text":"山翠濛濛曙欲分，鸡声髣髴隔溪闻。\n卧龙已去为霖雨，林屋空閒半榻云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第归后作","author":"樊阜","text":"牢落江湖几度春，布衣还是旧时贫。\n晚凉懒过溪头路，只恐沙鸥解笑人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜怀钱舜夫","author":"樊阜","text":"风雨西窗蟋蟀秋，怀人无寐转添愁。\n遥知今夜孤吟处，半壁青灯照白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登观音阁","author":"樊阜","text":"春深携客扣松关，今古兴怀俛仰间。\n花落花开俱是幻，老僧长对白云閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过名山坂","author":"樊阜","text":"槿篱断处路微分，茅屋砧声隔岸闻。\n暝色催人诗欲就，一声沙鸟半溪云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过河西务","author":"樊阜","text":"远树苍茫夕照低，短篷酤酒泊河西。\n王孙归去春无意，莎草含烟绿未齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"樊阜","text":"嘉树团阴石径分，数声啼鸟绿阴闻。\n桥西有客耽诗癖，买遍青山种白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题东坡墨竹","author":"樊阜","text":"赤壁归来燕寝香，梦骑玄鹤过三湘。\n玉箫唤醒月初堕，云影满帘秋气凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27159,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺怨","author":"樊阜","text":"花落深闺午漏迟，箜篌弹罢欲沾衣。\n东风绿遍江南草，底事王孙尚未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27160,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别次韵","author":"樊昌","text":"匹马对尊酒，送君归颍川。\n暮云深恋树，春草远连天。\n故国几千里，他乡一两年。\n何时复相见，去住各潸然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27161,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊庄呈李亚卿","author":"樊昌","text":"爱此村庄好，花开人正归。\n一篱含晓露，三径眩秋晖。\n异品题凡卉，幽香袭锦衣。\n看来心更逸，还忆侍彤闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27162,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画中小景","author":"樊昌","text":"扶桑日出光瞳曚，千门万户开春风。\n祥云带雨从龙去，朝朝暮暮飞天东。\n瀛洲弱水知何处，高人只在蓬山住。\n山外游人归未归，江上扁舟自来去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27163,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次正等寺壁间韵","author":"樊昌","text":"沙路盘旋溪水清，薜萝如幄晓烟平。\n檐前花落一两点，竹外鸟啼三四声。\n香雨霏微苍树湿，春风淡荡白云生。\n我来俯仰成今古，独有青山不世情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27164,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陶主事崇岳出使西蜀","author":"樊昌","text":"相送河桥酒一觞，独将琴剑对行装。\n东过阊阖家山远，西去阳关驿路长。\n马拂春风经峡口，雁冲寒雨过瞿塘。\n驱驰莫道丹心苦，白帝城高似故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27165,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李钝斋先生之江西","author":"樊昌","text":"独向云塘话别离，晚风吹雨湿征衣。\n水清江阔孤帆挂，云净天高一雁飞。\n远地若无南涧藻，故乡还有北山薇。\n沙头莫遣鸥盟冷，收拾琴书早赋归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27166,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妾薄命","author":"樊甫","text":"妾貌娇如花，妾心坚似石。\n石有碎时花早彫，妾貌未衰心不易。\n一自良人结缡后，寂莫香闺空自守。\n枕上翻思初嫁时，礼备媒行非苟苟。\n妾篚织成玄与黄，可以补衮供衣裳。\n妾筐采采蘋与藻，可以荐神享祖考。\n阿婆不顾小姑嗔，令妾进退难容身。\n双鬟懒结乌云薄，菱花半掩生芳尘。\n东邻少妇永相保，容颜未必倾城好。\n妾貌比之颇不恶，只恨生来多命薄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27167,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题水底猿捉月图","author":"樊甫","text":"漏板敲愁夜惊冷，露井梧桐湿无影。\n海风吹星消碧烟，青天不见纤月悬。\n嫦娥泪泣桂香死，谁知兔魄沈水底。\n巫猿激烈心欲飞，便伸长手搒摸之。\n夷神叱咤蛟龙怒，翻倒沧海上天去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27168,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽李司训妻","author":"樊甫","text":"青鸾西归海天暝，芙蓉十二画屏冷。\n剪刀无声落冰绡，月转梧桐夜窗静。\n些死巫阳招不回，纸钱断裂成尘埃。\n孤鸾吊影菱花惨，机头白石生苍苔。\n诸郎呱呱哀动地，雪色麻衣湿红泪。\n明朝扶榇过湘江，未见九疑心已碎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27169,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题岁寒图送贾大尹令弟","author":"樊甫","text":"登我徂徕山，瘦蛟怒立龙撑髯。\n天风振籁落金粉，石苔点破螭纹斑。\n舟回暮泊湘江曲，两岸清风凤毛绿。\n鹧鸪啼歇水云深，锦瑟无声睡初熟。\n明朝解缆过西湖，冰魂折裂青珊瑚。\n寒香浮动山月白，扣门夜半呼林逋。\n沈醉归来情脉脉，偶逢画史询行迹。\n挥毫写作岁寒图，旗亭远送天涯客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27170,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫女恩赐还家","author":"樊甫","text":"清晓承恩出禁宫，金莲香惹御阶风。\n九重回首如天上，万里还家似梦中。\n云髻高簪榴子石，宫衣深染茜花红。\n内家妆束原来别，不与寻常一样同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27171,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香奁和王彦修韵","author":"樊甫","text":"宝鸭烟消一字香，满怀春恨强梳妆。\n看花又怕东风恶，偷隔纱窗看海棠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27172,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答吴景端南归见寄之作 其一","author":"樊贵","text":"八月星槎下碧霄，归来休讶浙江潮。\n严林祠外苍林静，独带清风伴寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27173,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答吴景端南归见寄之作 其二","author":"樊贵","text":"回首青山长薜萝，椿庭日永紫芝歌。\n却嫌咫尺江郎路，笑杀仙人已烂柯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27174,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和李宾之韵","author":"樊瑩","text":"新年多遘逆，抱疴守空庐。\n竟日寡人事，反迂长者车。\n入门一相见，戒我毋枉趋。\n枉趋将何以，变故在须臾。\n念此重忧患，感叹复踌躇。\n信知明哲者，匪徒效虚无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27175,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张汝钦侍御","author":"樊瑩","text":"夙昔寡所予，惟子独吾契。\n闻过辄相规，见善复相示。\n迩来作离群，延颈日翘企。\n湘水只尺间，渺渺隔天际。\n念子富英迈，持法忘顾忌。\n抗节激流俗，高名惬时议。\n顾予驽钝姿，列官屡年岁。\n俛默守庸庸，兴言良独愧。\n古人重交游，匪从在忘势。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27176,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和时登叔祖湾河舟中作","author":"樊瑩","text":"阴风薄朝阳，方舟住溪侧。\n舟中有归人，怅然起忧色。\n长歌巷伯章，闻者重悽恻。\n信知青云子，永怀在君德。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27177,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜怀友和时登叔祖韵","author":"樊瑩","text":"林霏敛夕阴，庭际集繁霜。\n怀人不成寐，起视天苍苍。\n萧条履长夜，悽戚增悲伤。\n念彼离别久，中情讵能忘。\n徒见斗牛星，相距南北方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27178,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱塘行二首 其一","author":"樊鲲","text":"江舟泊危浪，江岸草霏微。\n寒风疾于箭，飒飒穿我衣。\n潮声日夜作，人去何时归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27179,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱塘行二首 其二","author":"樊鲲","text":"长年事击楫，感激海云生。\n山川自流转，奔逐空浮名。\n纷纷越南树，愁杀春鸠鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27180,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"利国驿上汉高皇祠","author":"樊鲲","text":"汉皇祠外抱江村，石径苔深长绿痕。\n潍水鸿沟俱不远，数声啼鸟向黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27181,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏蝶","author":"樊铎","text":"每从花底见，燕雀共翻飞。\n乘露酣春色，迎风舞綵衣。\n枝头常独宿，雨里不曾稀。\n篱落凋伤尽，残魂何处依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27182,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过诸暨口号","author":"樊铎","text":"泽国风光趁马归，青山一带夕阳西。\n野桥月出渔舟寂，春满田园花满堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27183,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茭道驿遇姚子卿","author":"樊铎","text":"柳路依依白日斜，新巢语燕野人家。\n旧时姚合题诗兴，次第春风数落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27184,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中行二首 其一","author":"樊铎","text":"四月浓阴风雨来，挥鞭遥指碧山开。\n征夫讶渡前村水，傍柳穿花去复回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27185,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中行二首 其二","author":"樊铎","text":"野外高楼护紫烟，落花飞处独淹淹。\n谁家双燕不归去，日暮空依古树边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27186,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松径风","author":"陈烓","text":"一径深且纡，森森覆松栝。\n清风池上来，幽思与之发。\n逸响谐素琴，凉阴散缃帙。\n弘景或可邀，高怀共清豁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27187,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山寺夏游","author":"陈烓","text":"素怀压嚣尘，况值烦暑逼。\n缅彼青莲宫，岧峣倚空碧。\n乘兴携素琴，绿云散轻策。\n山深岩径纡，境净松萝密。\n老衲忽相迎，坐我三生石。\n啜茗谈苦空，了然群虑息。\n昙花飘天香，岩翠落巾舄。\n回首盻尘区，营营果何益。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27188,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思母","author":"陈烓","text":"征夫日駪駪，王事忧靡盬。\n孤云何处来，悠扬自轻举。\n随风天外飞，往来无间阻。\n云下是义山，亲舍此其所。\n道远不可即，寸心良独苦。\n默默两忘言，翘首重延伫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27189,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀友","author":"陈烓","text":"美人在何方，去住不可度。\n闭目想仪容，冥心寄寥廓。\n忆昔论交日，看云时共酌。\n调我膝上琴，唤起松间鹤。\n青云惜分飞，白首欣有托。\n慎勿逐红尘，参商遽牢落。\n悠悠江上舟，喳喳檐头鹊。\n为报义溪鸥，还来寻旧约。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27190,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]